Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-Eighth Episode\NThe Black Knight\NThe Knight's Commandments
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.18,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see... "First of all, a fighting dog is a dog that knows nothing but fighting."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.28,0:02:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,"To raise one, you separate it from its mother as young as possible"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.80,0:02:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"so it learns to stand on its own."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.95,0:02:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,"Then you teach it only to fight,"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,"making it forget all emotions like sadness or joy."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, a dog without emotions... What a poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Dr. Uranari.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.64,0:02:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.18,0:02:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.14,0:02:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All that fills its head is the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And fighting that enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.79,0:02:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.86,0:02:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.19,0:02:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about fighting dogs. Dogs stripped of their emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate snakes and dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this dog is Grand Duke Duralumin's pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.55,0:02:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe an animal can be emotionless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.73,0:03:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what kind of dog it is, if you show it affection, it'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.81,0:03:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, cute little doggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.57,0:03:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.63,0:03:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.61,0:03:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.43,0:03:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong with my pet, Dr. Uranari?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.37,0:03:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.98,0:03:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't keep it inside its kennel, it's dangerous! Even if it is just a pet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.59,0:03:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone bitten by such a cute creature must be totally out of their mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.48,0:03:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But more importantly, I'll show you something even better later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.65,0:03:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Something better?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.54,0:03:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.23,0:03:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just say I'm out of my mind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.21,0:04:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Who put a rope across a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This hallway is the shortcut to Sapphire's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.26,0:04:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrifying dog, attacking for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.01,0:04:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.14,0:04:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Lord Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.04,0:04:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you... still trying to fight back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you brute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.10,0:04:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this dog be...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong with my fighting dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well. Lord Sapphire, coming out in person?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what a fine specimen looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.53,0:04:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A fine specimen? You meant this fighting dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:04:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Putting him in the room!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.64,0:04:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.52,0:05:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a good look, Lord Sapphire. See what a fighting dog really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.17,0:05:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it awful to put a dog through something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.38,0:05:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Awful, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.39,0:05:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A fighting dog is raised through relentless torment. Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.83,0:05:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the dog in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Up to here, it's just like the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.63,0:05:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, this is that fighting dog's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.35,0:05:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Hey, that's your mother right there! Don't you recognize her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.82,0:06:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Will it never be able to act like a normal dog again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible. Dogs don't feel parent-child affection like humans do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing, forgetting your own mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.61,0:06:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Uranari, isn't there any way to turn those vicious hounds back into normal dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.18,0:06:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Since they've already been trained to that extreme, I'm afraid it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.36,0:06:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin's growing arrogance is quite a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.66,0:06:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It bloomed! It bloomed before I knew it! Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.05,0:06:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I raised this myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dr. Uranari, can I go to the border?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,To the border?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.39,0:07:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised to give them to Franze once the tulips bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.87,0:07:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! It won't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.41,0:07:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop right there! I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.77,0:07:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you get in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.81,0:07:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes there?! Beyond this point lies Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.26,0:07:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So you wanna fight?! Get him, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.27,0:08:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You bunch of cowards! I am Jingis, an apprentice knight of Bururu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.01,0:08:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't your kingdom have a princess named Sapphire who boasts of her skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Then Lord Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.15,0:08:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Defeat just one more famous knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.84,0:08:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll become an official knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And that knight is Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.79,0:08:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.81,0:08:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.98,0:08:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.62,0:08:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the border guard?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.78,0:08:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's terrible! This man is after Lord Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.50,0:08:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you Sapphire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.36,0:09:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Do you have business with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, duel me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.77,0:09:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be a girl, but you're a famous knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.91,0:09:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If I defeat you, the King of Bururu will grant me knighthood!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.58,0:09:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We've only just met, and you already want to fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got somewhere to go right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.26,0:09:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Running away?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.94,0:09:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Precious tulips for Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.70,0:09:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And you call yourself Jingis?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! If a fight is what you want, you've got one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, draw your sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.15,0:09:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.81,0:09:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.02,0:09:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong with that tulip?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.57,0:09:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom loved tulips.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.18,0:09:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So whenever I see one, it always reminds me of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.63,0:09:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.37,0:09:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.58,0:09:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.14,0:09:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.66,0:10:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have a mother, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.25,0:10:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. After my dad died and our family fell apart, my mom saw me crying...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.08,0:10:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,...said a crybaby wasn't her child, and walked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was abandoned like a stray pup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.52,0:10:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Jingis...so you're trying to become a knight to rebuild your family's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.03,0:10:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.94,0:10:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! The Black Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.88,0:10:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He followed me all the way here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.32,0:10:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been targeting me ever since I was a toddler!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.97,0:10:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about the Black Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.71,0:10:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, I just need to defeat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.40,0:10:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.72,0:11:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out! An avalanche!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.18,0:12:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.64,0:12:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.32,0:12:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.43,0:12:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.52,0:12:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jingis!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Jingis!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.98,0:13:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Jingis!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.38,0:13:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, hold onto this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! As if I'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I'd let my opponent save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.68,0:13:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.66,0:13:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about dueling Sapphire and hurry back to your own countries!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.47,0:13:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.60,0:13:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We will definitely settle this once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.68,0:14:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This rope won't break, so climb on up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.19,0:14:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal, what's wrong? Why did you stop all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.92,0:14:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is that Black Knight's glove.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink some of Mother's tea. You must be cold, right? Let's have hot tea and cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.69,0:14:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.90,0:14:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Are you lost in thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.39,0:14:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, try this glove on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.93,0:14:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a black glove.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.41,0:14:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it big?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it fits Mother perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.75,0:14:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A perfect fit? The Black Knight is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.34,0:14:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all this commotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.82,0:15:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way! If you won't let me pass, I'll force my way through!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,An intruder! Don't let him into the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring Sapphire out! Where is Sapphire? Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.73,0:15:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.64,0:15:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.03,0:15:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.98,0:15:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to take me on is laughable!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.11,0:15:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.02,0:16:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They're like wild beasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.34,0:16:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you hounds, come at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.56,0:16:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You lot, get back to your rooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.70,0:16:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Grand Duke Duralumin. What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.28,0:16:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Jingis, a knight-in-training from the Land of Bururu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.93,0:16:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to challenge Princess Sapphire to a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a formal challenge signed by the King of Bururu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.77,0:16:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.35,0:17:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To Sapphire, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.64,0:17:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks as sharp as a blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.71,0:17:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Handed a formal challenge to a duel signed by the King,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.18,0:17:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire won't be able to refuse as a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then take me to her already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.30,0:17:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be in such a rush. Come this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine! If you want to fight that badly, I'll take you on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.84,0:17:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait, Lord Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.09,0:17:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Uranari, let go of my cloak!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.44,0:17:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire, do you hold a grudge against that boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.14,0:17:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.40,0:17:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And that boy holds no grudge against you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.60,0:17:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It is only this code of knighthood that forces him to defeat a famous knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I run away, I'll become everyone's laughingstock!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.93,0:17:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please call off this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.76,0:17:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you supposed to be the one who breaks bad rules and creates new ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.86,0:18:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you gone to bed yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure it'll be done tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.59,0:18:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me. Get a good rest tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.46,0:18:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better be right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.74,0:18:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.38,0:18:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A tulip!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.01,0:18:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Whenever I see this flower, I always think of my mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Jingis! Jingis! It's your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama! Mama! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.48,0:18:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Jingis! Listen to me! Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.07,0:18:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Jingis, you are not a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.91,0:18:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting like a mindless weapon to become a knight won't bring you happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.11,0:18:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Jingis. You weren't born just to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.95,0:18:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:19:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I've turned so many into my enemies and fought desperately.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.98,0:19:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting is all I know how to do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.49,0:19:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.82,0:19:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.72,0:19:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Jingis?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What the—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.70,0:19:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this, Grand Duke Duralumin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.82,0:19:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's finally back to his senses. You're still not a true weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.07,0:19:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, you'll never defeat Sapphire and finish her off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.22,0:19:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it! I will do it! Just watch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.35,0:19:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.69,0:19:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like there's no choice but to fight after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.21,0:19:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.98,0:20:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.16,0:20:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.23,0:20:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.05,0:20:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Sapphire is missing? Where could she have gone, Dr. Uranari?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.16,0:20:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I... have no idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.74,0:20:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She ran away. It seems Silverland's heir is a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin! You go too far! I've had enough of these rumors!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.13,0:20:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If this happens, we won't be able to face other nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.63,0:20:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where on earth could Sapphire have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.52,0:20:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Magesty, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.21,0:20:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.03,0:20:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.22,0:20:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, you coward, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.00,0:20:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you hiding?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.64,0:20:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you that scared of me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.35,0:20:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Sapphire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.34,0:20:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You spineless Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.82,0:20:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.14,0:21:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear God, please understand. I am not hiding because I am afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.86,0:21:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.24,0:21:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiding won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.31,0:21:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My nose is better than a dog's!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.23,0:21:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Jingis, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.43,0:21:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please give up on this foolish fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.97,0:21:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,First, pick whichever weapon you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.43,0:21:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Jingis!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.14,0:21:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Begging for mercy? Did you lose your nerve?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! I'll use the whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.34,0:21:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Let the match begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.17,0:21:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Jingis!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.13,0:21:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Black Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.19,0:21:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A woman?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.21,0:21:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.49,0:21:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.31,0:21:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Jingis!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:21:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.69,0:22:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive your Mama. Mama saw everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.58,0:22:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,To rebuild our fallen family, I disguised myself as the Black Knight to train you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.80,0:22:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But I realized our people's rule—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.25,0:22:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,that simply defeating the strong is all that matters—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.51,0:22:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,was foolish and wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.42,0:22:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama was wrong. Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.64,0:22:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.95,0:22:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That dog turned into a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.23,0:22:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Lord Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.15,0:22:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I'll never forget you. Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.95,0:22:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.51,0:22:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.02,0:22:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you all the best!
